ve, solve the moral dilemma of an alien whose pacifist thinking is not approved by the majority of his race, save the rainforest from destruction, and perform other good deeds that will perhaps prove to the Powers-That-Be that humanity can be allowed to exist.", "summary": "Callahan's Crosstime Saloon is a puzzle-solving adventure game based on Spider Robinson's series of stories about the unusual patrons of Callahan's bar. The characters in the game are taken from the first book of the series, though their stories are original. The game's world is composed of still screens viewed from first-person perspective. The interaction is point-and-click, with context menus appearing when the player attempts to interact with an object on screen.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/callahans-crosstime-saloon", "characters": [{"id": 6618, "name": "Al Phee"}, {"id": 6616, "name": "Bottleship Boy"}, {"id": 6598, "name": "Sigmund Kiscolon"}, {"id": 6619, "name": "Dr. Duplisidus"}, {"id": 6595, "name": "Fast Eddie"}, {"id": 6037, "mug_shot": {"id": 3619, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ae5unhbpw18auejmxxxo.jpg"}, "name": "Sasha"}, {"id": 6614, "name": "Squish"}, {"id": 6608, "name": "Wereworth's Clerk"}, {"id": 6601, "name": "Ziv"}, {"id": 6594, "name": "Mickey Finn"}, {"id": 6615, "name": "TV Announcer"}, {"id": 1530, "name": "Jake"}, {"id": 6593, "name": "Doc"}, {"id": 3755, "name": "Tina"}, {"id": 6605, "name": "Trap Driver"}, {"id": 6611, "name": "Telephone Voice"}, {"id": 6613, "name": "Noah"}, {"id": 5826, "name": "Tor"}, {"id": 6631, "name": "Board Member #3"}, {"id": 6627, "name": "Bystander"}, {"id": 6629, "name": "Board Member #1"}, {"id": 6603, "name": "Fugato"}, {"id": 6602, "name": "Casimir"}, {"id": 6625, "name": "Punk"}, {"id": 6620, "name": "Glazier"}, {"id": 6599, "name": "Alaniz"}, {"id": 6604, "name": "Chives"}, {"id": 6592, "n